{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_by_MathTalks_😉\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video by MathTalks 😉</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle(Goes_through_the_full_thought_process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes through the full thought process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In January <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/0987dc78864e4bfa39ea188378f155625e3fb231.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1980$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> the Mauna Loa Observatory recorded carbon dioxide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/d/22d21f0b907ec765893e8d2cfa2d764bf6a09b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(CO2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> levels of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/43093783cbb45324bb31400814c631ce1b21f72d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$338$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> ppm (parts per million). Over the years the average <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06b164032b08d57abb42ab281b2ac50d2c47f6de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CO2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> reading has increased by about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b8ba6db5424459f22dc618e2e8f32a97bac3c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.515$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> ppm each year. What is the expected <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06b164032b08d57abb42ab281b2ac50d2c47f6de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CO2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> level in ppm in January <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/5/a757eb593d295e7cc5b3ef011f94248de9cc56c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2030$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />? Round your answer to the nearest integer. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/c/4cc34294fa84a7a75e84696c83a36373f0ae15c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 399\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 414\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 420\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 444\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 459$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is a time period of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a4b63c7ab8de3da2623489a70b1171175f899fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2030 - 1980 = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" /> years, so we can expect the ppm to increase by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/4/634cff2090e7569457f75a285d8244b4b7abe31a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50*1.515=75.75\\approx\t76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"187\" height=\"14\" /> ppm.\nSince we started with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/0/43093783cbb45324bb31400814c631ce1b21f72d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$338$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> ppm, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/3/bd3400bc713c0bbd2fb90ead9dab4f994cc25b95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76+338=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)\\ 414}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"168\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>-ILoveMath31415926535\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a4b63c7ab8de3da2623489a70b1171175f899fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2030 - 1980 = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" /> years.\nThe ppm level in 2030 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca38752e2549da687168d4bcbc227a792cd8f5bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$338 + 50 * 1.515 = 338 + 75.75 = 413.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"318\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/4/5344440b94a085e52645b5af879994b8e7247855.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\approx\t\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)\\ 414}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"96\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~thebanker88\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From Jan 1980 =338 ppm increase\n</p><p>= 1.515 ppm increased / year\n</p><p>= 50 yrs (in this case)\n=1.515 x 50 \n</p><p>=75.75 ~ 76\n</p><p>Thus, 2030 prediction = 338 + 76 = 414 = option B \n</p><p>~ Runningmouse\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8GHuS5HEoWc\">https://youtu.be/8GHuS5HEoWc</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_by_MathTalks_.F0.9F.98.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_by_MathTalks_😉\">Video by MathTalks 😉</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video by MathTalks 😉\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9GVWXv9Pg1E?si=lhCKMjJ0wvfc_MfY\">https://youtu.be/9GVWXv9Pg1E?si=lhCKMjJ0wvfc_MfY</a>\n</p>\n<pre>~rc1219\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oMYs2Gg0ays\">https://youtu.be/oMYs2Gg0ays</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle.28Goes_through_the_full_thought_process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Central_Valley_Math_Circle(Goes_through_the_full_thought_process)\">Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes through the full thought process)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes through the full thought process)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qjb6WP1gjIQ\">https://youtu.be/qjb6WP1gjIQ</a>\n</p><p>~mr_mathman\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_fully_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_fully_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First fully understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=kk52okhz__aC8g9l&amp;t=2078\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=kk52okhz__aC8g9l&amp;t=2078</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=ATKTcOdaVPGWU8_V&amp;t=1089\">https://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=ATKTcOdaVPGWU8_V&amp;t=1089</a>\n</p><p>~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_.28easy_to_digest.29_by_Power_Solve\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution 1 (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 (easy to digest)